{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af4056872cdfbba67e1e2e9cd14bf429618efca4d795e5910481e63154e6ff6c", "ja": "（童話を題材にしたドラマの撮影が、無事終わった。\nロコは、自分の役をしっかり演じ切った！）", "zh": "（以童话为题材的电视剧拍摄顺利结束了。ROCO也好好地演完了自己的角色！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "7ef4a03b70fbfb403a196084606d6adfe28d99b116de68eabc4747b52dc5ac39", "ja": "ここにいましたか、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまです♪", "zh": "原来您在这里啊，{$P$}。辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0a46fc75bdc7cff5c064cb8817dad7132ae3e48410c392aaf5ca827735dfa19a", "ja": "お疲れさま、ロコ。\n長い撮影期間、よく頑張ったな。", "zh": "辛苦了，ROCO。\n这么长的拍摄周期，真是辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f1ccc46df19e5afb458607c1f13a2e37d6bd55cefc84073788402cd8f6dde956", "ja": "『塔の中でジオラマを作るラプンツェル』って、\n少し変わった設定だったけど、大変じゃなかったか？", "zh": "“在塔中制作立体模型的长发公主”，这个设定有点特别，拍摄期间没觉得辛苦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "7512617aafdfeb757673e439c20aa59389c7d6a2cdf6490133f64e1962e316cf", "ja": "ノープロブレムです！　ビッグなジオラマを\nクリエイトできるなんて、ロコにピッタリです！", "zh": "没问题！能创作这么大型的立体模型，\n简直太适合ROCO了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "2d38bf79a91cdfaa2a9650835f2fbcc15c9d14d55d6fe9e0c0f69b1c05ec217b", "ja": "でも、ジオラマに夢中になりすぎて、\n監督さんに何度も怒られちゃいましたけど……。", "zh": "不过，因为太沉迷于立体模型，被导演先生训了好几次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1006_p", "source_sha256": "521ae005b187588eb3acf4c400604f13d0dc1c0eff7a1f9f873495d7200f5436", "ja": "ははっ、そうだったな。だけど、\nラプンツェルの性格がよく表現できてたと思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。不过，我觉得你把长发公主的性格表现得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "95484f17434be727d3247ade3ee8e2d2091423c82aed10f6f68ec339b796ab54", "ja": "サンクスです！　はじめは、\n塔の中で孤独なラプンツェルでしたけど……。", "zh": "谢谢啦！　一开始，我还是住在塔中孤独的长发公主，\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "6b009bb3ce4bed3270f8965d6611a050baa7e8f5c12f8e99381b52eb3e33a1c4", "ja": "ちょっとずつ心をオープンすることで、\nイマジネーションがエクスプロージョンしました！", "zh": "通过一点一点敞开心扉，想象力爆发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5d238ae3ca99fc44cafe3d548fd7268f70679fc35ff29148fdf472fc85bea3a5", "ja": "ああ。撮影を見てたけど、\n気持ちの変化がわかりやすかった気がするな。", "zh": "啊。我一直在看拍摄过程，感觉你的心情变化似乎很容易看出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "c64e6be42ad5ffcce50b2f6068423d5364bb8c9db0b9365a4c55517ec2f8ef9c", "ja": "本当ですか！？　アートとハートは、コネクトして\nますからね。それをアレンジしてみたんです。", "zh": "真的吗！？艺术与心灵是相通的嘛。所以我就试着把这一点重新编排了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "805ec154238d475b074703aa99006dcf5e3a0e7b69f143149916da529cc3ab49", "ja": "でも本番になったら、ラプンツェルの気持ちと\nシンクロしてしまって。手が勝手に……えへへっ。", "zh": "可是到了正式演出时，我不知不觉就和拉普伦策尔的心情同步了。手自己就动起来了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d93e42ee066a597fac5618d5ec358242e587416fd341fba555f9e85d2cbd7de1", "ja": "おお、すごいな……。もしかしたら、\n今回の役にシンパシーを感じたのかもしれないな。", "zh": "哦，真厉害啊……说不定，你是对这次的角色产生了共鸣吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "9df735b7eb610fe9e2425a75a366c6dd8dc0f5dace6cddfea24b4dad96be937b", "ja": "そうですね。ロコもラプンツェルと同じで、\nミニマムなワールドに閉じこもってましたから……。", "zh": "是啊。ROCO也和长发公主一样，一直把自己关在一个小小的世界里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "619d47d222728ea079c61e35607657ea2d5f40d2c4a05a8bfe6984278f1a54a3", "ja": "彼女がアートをエンジョイしたみたいに、\nロコもロコズアートをエンジョイしたいって思います！", "zh": "就像她享受艺术那样，\nROCO也想去享受ROCO的艺术！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3dcbab69b029ce6e7516a018e7af026402da5a4dfed6ad6139ba0ca9b8c617fd", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nロコが楽しめば、きっと彼女も喜んでくれるよ。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。只要ROCO开心，她一定也会高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "59e0de212188e633df49a99f634f6e7d447c63383cb596c09a97d6eda3dfb588", "ja": "ハッ！　な、なんだかイマジネーションが～～～！\n{$P$}、早く劇場に帰りましょう！", "zh": "哈！总、总觉得灵感要喷涌而出了———！\n{$P$}，我们快回剧场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0283_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "4aac936ef86e8e153dd340a03beab9fc0fbfadaf1ad9f6fd11f15ce328712cdb", "ja": "ラプンツェルをテーマにしたアートが閃きました！\nこれはマスターピースになりそうな予感です、ふふっ♪", "zh": "我突然想到一个以长发公主为主题的艺术创意！\n感觉它会成为一件杰作，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
